OL,3,AI opened cockpit door of plane while
OL,4,Abeing attacked, Indian pilot tells Modi
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndian pilot Smit Machchhar has said he
OL,7,Fopened the cockpit door of the
OL,8,FIsrael-bound Flydubai plane to allow
OL,9,Fpassengers to come in and halt its
OL,10,Frapid descent.
OL,12,FIn a video call with Indian Prime
OL,13,FMinister Narendra Modi, Capt Machchhar
OL,14,Fsaid he was on the ground and still
OL,15,Fbeing attacked by his co-pilot when he
OL,16,Frealised the plane was sinking and he
OL,17,Fhad to do something.
OL,19,F"I was lying on the floor injured but I
OL,20,Ftold myself to go for one last push to
OL,21,Fopen the door from inside," he said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
