OL,3,AI opened cockpit door of plane while
OL,4,Abeing attacked, Indian pilot tells Modi
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Others came in and also played a role
OL,7,F[in controlling the situation]. I was
OL,8,Fof course fighting for my own life but
OL,9,Fat the same time I knew I was not going
OL,10,Fto let others die," he added.
